nct button to avoid triggering selection","Add explicit interaction states: default/hover/active/focus/selected/disabled for both the card container and delete action, mapped to design tokens","Define async behaviors for delete: disable delete while pending, show progress indicator, handle success removal animation, and show error with retry","Provide screen-reader-friendly strings for masked number and expiry (e.g., 'Visa ending in 1234, expires 05/27, John Doe') and mark brand icon decorative if redundant","Document focus rules: initial focus target, focus ring styling, and post-delete focus placement (next card, previous card, or list container)"],"responsiveGaps":["Layout behavior for narrow widths is unspecified (stacking order of brand icon, number, expiry, name, and delete action)","Text overflow/truncation rules are missing for long cardholder names and small containers (ellipsis vs wrap, max lines)","Placement of delete action on mobile is undefined (right-aligned, overflow menu, second row) and how it avoids accidental taps","Minimum touch target sizes and spacing between selectable area and delete control are not specified for mobile","Handling of RTL locales is unspecified (icon/fields alignment and delete placement mirroring)"]},"parsing":{"businessContext":"Merchant dashboard UI for displaying and managing saved payment methods.","components":[{"code":"payment_card","name":"Payment Card","parentCode":null,"purpose":"Display a saved payment method summary with key card details and actions.","statePolicy":"dumb","type":"card"},{"code":"card_brand_icon","name":"Card Brand Icon","parentCode":"payment_card","purpose":"Indicate the payment card brand (e.g., Visa, Mastercard, Amex).","statePolicy":"dumb","type":"icon"},{"code":"card_number_masked","name":"Masked Card Number","parentCode":"payment_card","purpose":"Show the masked primary account number with last 4 digits visible.","statePolicy":"dumb","type":"field"},{"code":"card_expiry_date","name":"Expiry D