ner styling such as padding and internal spacing between icon, fields, and actions.","name":"card spacing","type":"spacing"},{"componentCode":"payment_card","description":"Corner rounding for the payment card container.","name":"card radius","type":"radius"},{"componentCode":"payment_card","description":"Elevation/shadow used to separate the card from the background.","name":"card shadow","type":"shadow"},{"componentCode":"payment_card","description":"Typography for card number, expiry, and cardholder labels/values.","name":"card typography","type":"typography"},{"componentCode":"card_brand_icon","description":"Icon asset set for supported card brands (Visa/Mastercard/Amex).","name":"card brand icons","type":"icon"},{"componentCode":null,"description":"Text and surface colors used within the payment card component.","name":"payment method colors","type":"color"}]},"projectRootPath":"/app/generated/frontend","relatedComponentInterfaces":[],"relatedComponentSourceFiles":[],"resolvingGaps":{"decisions":[{"affectedComponentCodes":["payment_card"],"code":"selection_pattern_radio_item","decision":"Implement selection as a single focusable control on the card container using a native <button type="button"> with aria-pressed to represent selected state (true when selected, false otherwise). Activate selection on Enter/Space and click/tap anywhere on the card excluding the delete control.","rationale":"This defines an unambiguous keyboard and screen reader interaction model without requiring an external radiogroup context, while still supporting a clear selected/unselected toggle state for a dumb card component.","sourceGap":"Selection affordance is undefined (entire card vs radio/button), so keyboard interaction pattern and semantic role/aria-checked labeling are missing"},{"affectedComponentCodes":["payment_card","delete_card_action"],"code":"delete_is_distinct_button_stop_propagation","decision":"Render delete as a separate <button type="button"> inside the card. Prevent 