ible focus ring on card and delete, focus order, and where focus goes after deletion)"},{"affectedComponentCodes":["card_brand_icon"],"code":"brand_icon_decorative_by_default","decision":"Treat the card brand icon as decorative by default: render with empty alt (alt="") for <img> or aria-hidden="true" for inline SVG. The accessible brand text must be included in the payment_card accessible label (not on the icon).","rationale":"This prevents duplicate announcements while still ensuring the brand is conveyed once through the overall card label, which is the most stable and testable approach.","sourceGap":"Card brand icon alternative text/aria-hidden behavior is not specified (decorative vs informative)"},{"affectedComponentCodes":["payment_card","card_number_masked","card_expiry_date","cardholder_name"],"code":"screen_reader_label_format","decision":"Do not rely on reading visible masked characters. Provide an explicit accessible label for the payment_card in the format: "{Brand} card ending in {last4}, expires {MM}/{YY}, {CardholderName}". Keep the visible masked number as "•••• •••• •••• {last4}" (or "**** **** **** {last4}") but exclude the mask characters from the accessible label.","rationale":"This avoids screen readers announcing asterisks/bullets and standardizes the spoken output using non-sensitive identifiers, resolving ambiguity about announced formats.","sourceGap":"Text announced format is unspecified for masked number and expiry (e.g., reading out asterisks vs 'ending in 1234', 'expires 05/27')"},{"affectedComponentCodes":["payment_card","delete_card_action"],"code":"interaction_states_minimum_set","decision":"Implement and expose the following visual states with distinct styling hooks: payment_card: default, hover, active/pressed, focus-visible, selected, disabled. delete_card_action: default, hover, active/pressed, focus-visible, disabled. Selected state must include a clear indicator (e.g., 2px border + subtle background) in addition to any shadow c