t actions, and spacing between sections)","Long step labels and status text truncation/wrapping behavior is undefined (especially in narrow widths)","Document upload drop zone sizing and behavior on mobile is unspecified (full-width vs fixed, tap target sizing, drag-and-drop not available)","Handling of multiple uploaded files on small screens is undefined (list layout, scrolling, preview thumbnail sizing, action overflow)","Selfie capture UI responsiveness is unspecified (camera preview aspect ratio, orientation changes, safe-area handling)","Verification status layout on small screens is unspecified (status badge size, message stacking, action placement if any)"]},"parsing":{"businessContext":"KYC verification wizard for collecting personal information, uploading identity documents, capturing selfie, and showing verification status.","components":[{"code":"kyc_verification_wizard","name":"KYC verification wizard","parentCode":null,"purpose":"Guide the user through KYC steps with navigation and final status display.","statePolicy":"smart","type":"wizard"},{"code":"kyc_step_indicator","name":"Step indicator","parentCode":"kyc_verification_wizard","purpose":"Display the current step and overall progress across the 3-step wizard.","statePolicy":"dumb","type":"step_indicator"},{"code":"personal_info_step","name":"Personal info step","parentCode":"kyc_verification_wizard","purpose":"Collect the user's personal information.","statePolicy":"dumb","type":"form"},{"code":"document_upload_step","name":"Document upload step","parentCode":"kyc_verification_wizard","purpose":"Collect identity document files via drag-and-drop or file picker.","statePolicy":"smart","type":"file_upload"},{"code":"selfie_step","name":"Selfie step","parentCode":"kyc_verification_wizard","purpose":"Collect a selfie for verification.","statePolicy":"dumb","type":"form"},{"code":"wizard_back_button","name":"Back button","parentCode":"kyc_verification_wizard","purpose":"Navigate to the previous step in 