y" action; Next remains disabled until all remaining files are in a successful state or removed.","rationale":"This specifies in-progress, failure, retry, and navigation locking behavior required for a robust upload step without inventing server-specific progress APIs.","sourceGap":"Document upload in-progress state is unspecified (uploading indicator, per-file progress, cancel/remove)"},{"affectedComponentCodes":["selfie_step"],"code":"selfie_capture_and_fallback_states","decision":"Provide two options in the selfie step: "Use camera" and "Upload a photo". Camera path: show live preview (16:9 container that scales responsively), buttons "Capture" and "Retake" (native buttons). If permission is denied or camera unavailable, automatically switch to the upload option and display an inline message "Camera unavailable. Upload a selfie instead." Upload path accepts .jpg/.jpeg/.png up to 10MB and shows a preview with "Remove/Replace".","rationale":"This defines a complete, accessible selfie collection approach including denied/unavailable states and a non-camera fallback, aligning with the gap without over-specifying UI beyond necessary controls.","sourceGap":"Selfie step states are missing (camera permission denied, camera unavailable, capture in progress, retake, upload fallback)"},{"affectedComponentCodes":["kyc_verification_wizard","wizard_next_button","wizard_back_button"],"code":"final_submission_and_global_error","decision":"On Step 3 Next, perform a final submission request. During submission, disable Back/Next and change Next label to "Submitting…". On submission success, replace step content with the verification status view defaulting to "Pending review". On API failure (fetch existing status or submit), render a global inline error banner at the top of the wizard (role="alert") with text "Something went wrong. Please try again." and a "Retry" button that repeats the failed request.","rationale":"This explicitly defines the missing submission state and global error handling with a simple retry mechanism, enabling deterministic UX and test coverage without assuming complex backend flows.","sourceGap":"Final submission state is missing (submitting KYC package before status is shown)"},{"affectedComponentCodes":["verification_status"],"code":"status_non_color_and_rejection_reason","decision":"Render status with both icon and text: Pending review (clock icon), Approved (check icon), Rejected (x icon). Include a screen-reader label that announces "Verification status: {status}". For Rejected, display a "Reason" text block if provided by API; if no reason is available, show "Reason: Not provided". For Rejected, also show a primary action "Start over" that resets the wizard to Step 1 and clears step data in local state.","rationale":"This resolves reliance on color alone and defines a conservative rejection follow-up that does not assume partial editability; it provides a clear next action and works whether or not a reason is returned.","sourceGap":"Rejected status follow-up state is unspecified (whether rejection includes reason text and what user can do next)"},{"affectedComponentCodes":["kyc_verification_wizard","kyc_step_indicator","document_upload_step","verification_status"],"code":"responsive_layout_rules","decision":"For widths < 480px: step indicator stacks vertically with full-width items and wraps long labels to multiple lines (no truncation). Back/Next actions become a sticky bottom bar with Back on the left and Next on the right, each min-height 44px. Document upload drop zone becomes full-width with min-height 120px and tap targets (buttons) at least 44px tall. Uploaded files render as a vertical list with filename wrapping and actions in a trailing overflow menu if needed. Verification status content stacks: icon+status on first row, message/reason below, actions full-width.","rationale":"This defines concrete mobile behavior for wrapping, sizing, and action placement using conservative accessibility-friendly sizi