ders file rows from the controlled files prop","Invokes on_remove_file with the correct file_id from a file row action","Invokes on_retry_file with the correct file_id for an error file row action","Disables interactive controls when is_disabled is true (drop zone and row actions)"],"coveredStates":["Default/empty state (no files, enabled)","Error summary visible","With successful file rows","With uploading file row","With failed file row (retry available)","Disabled state"],"files":[{"filename":"/app/generated/frontend/src/components/DocumentUploadStep/DocumentUploadStep.spec.tsx","content":"import React from 'react';
