ther middle-click/new-tab is supported, and whether there is a dedicated 'View details' action","Provide explicit status-to-style mapping (badge background/text colors) and contrast requirements; include fallback styling for unknown statuses","Document data overflow behavior per column (truncate with ellipsis, wrap, tooltip on hover/focus) especially for merchant name and payment method"],"responsiveGaps":["Define small-screen behavior for 5-column table (horizontal scroll vs column stacking vs hiding lower-priority columns)","Specify how pagination layout adapts on mobile (page size selector placement, collapsing page numbers, sticky footer/header behavior)","Define responsive truncation/line-wrapping rules for long merchant names and payment methods to avoid layout breakage","Clarify minimum column widths and whether the table becomes scrollable within a container to prevent viewport overflow"]},"parsing":{"businessContext":"View and browse a list of transactions with sorting, pagination, status indicators, and access to transaction details.","components":[{"code":"transaction_table","name":"Transaction Table","parentCode":null,"purpose":"Display transactions in a sortable, paginated table with status badges and row-level access to details.","statePolicy":"smart","type":"table"},{"code":"transaction_table_pagination","name":"Transaction Table Pagination","parentCode":"transaction_table","purpose":"Control page navigation and page size for the transaction list.","statePolicy":"smart","type":"pagination"},{"code":"transaction_status_badge","name":"Transaction Status Badge","parentCode":"transaction_table","purpose":"Render a colored status badge for each transaction status value.","statePolicy":"dumb","type":"badge"}],"constraints":[{"componentCode":"transaction_table","description":"Supports sorting by any column.","type":"sorting"},{"componentCode":"transaction_table","description":"Pagination supports 25/50/100 items per page.","type":"pagination"}],"content":[{"