defaults that may be overridden by component styling.","sourceGap":"No focus-visible styling requirements specified for sortable headers, rows, and pagination controls"},{"affectedComponentCodes":["transaction_table_status_badge"],"code":"status_badge_contrast_and_noncolor_redundancy","decision":"Badges always render the status text (Pending/Completed/Failed/Refunded) and must meet WCAG 2.1 AA contrast for text against badge background (>=4.5:1). If a chosen background cannot meet contrast with the intended text color, use a neutral background with a 2px left border in the status color and standard text color to preserve meaning without relying on low-contrast fills.","rationale":"Text provides non-color reinforcement, and the contrast rule plus fallback prevents inaccessible color pairings while preserving status differentiation in a conservative way.","sourceGap":"Status badges rely on color; no non-color reinforcement specified beyond text and no guidance for contrast-compliant badge/background pairings"},{"affectedComponentCodes":["transaction_table"],"code":"cell_overflow_truncation_rules","decision":"Merchant Name and Payment Method cells are single-line with truncation (CSS ellipsis). On hover and keyboard focus (within cell), show a native tooltip via title attribute containing the full value. Row height remains fixed to a single line.","rationale":"This defines deterministic overflow handling on narrow widths without introducing complex custom tooltip components, and it remains accessible via focus-triggered title for keyboard users.","sourceGap":"Long-content overflow state for merchant name and payment method (truncate/wrap) and tooltip behavior if used"},{"affectedComponentCodes":["transaction_table"],"code":"responsive_table_horizontal_scroll_and_column_priority","decision":"On small screens, keep the table layout and enable horizontal scrolling within the table container (overflow-x: auto). Columns remain in the same order and are not hidden; minimum widths: Date 120px, Amount 120px, Status 120px, Merchant Name 200px, Payment Method 160px.","rationale":"Horizontal scroll is the least risky responsive strategy for a data table because it preserves all data and interactions without inventing a card layout or column hiding behavior not specified in the brief.","sourceGap":"No behavior defined for small screens: whether the table becomes horizontally scrollable, columns collapse, or transforms into a stacked/card layout"}]},"unitTests":{"components":[{"componentCode":"transaction_table_status_badge","componentName":"Transaction Status Badge","coveredBehaviors":["Renders the correct human-readable label for each supported status (pending/completed/failed/refunded)","Exposes status text in the accessible name (not color-only meaning)","Applies a status-specific styling hook (via class or data attribute) so status can be colored by CSS","Merges optional class_name with the component's base styling hook"],"coveredStates":["Pending","Completed","Failed","Refunded"],"files":[{"filename":"/app/generated/frontend/src/components/TransactionTableStatusBadge/TransactionTableStatusBadge.spec.tsx","content":"import React from 'react';
